<title>VENEZUELA: Ford's Venezuela unit certified by ISO.</title>
<headline>Ford's Venezuela unit certified by ISO.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co's Venezuelan unit received on Wednesday the Covenin ISO-9002 certificate signifying that the company's plant in Valencia meets demanding global quality standards.</p>
<p>&quot;The certificate will help us open Andean markets ... and reinforces our export drive,&quot; said Ford de Venezuela operations manager Felix Navas in a press statement.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 834405</p>
</text>
